2026-09-02T17:59:38-06:00 CRITICAL HARNESS BUG FOUND (pilot run, tag pilot-check): pibench.run_pi invokes PI_BIN=~/scoop/persist/nodejs-lts/bin/pi.cmd. On Windows a .cmd is launched via cmd.exe, which TRUNCATES the argv at the first newline. Every task prompt therefore reaches pi as ONLY ITS FIRST LINE. Verified: pi echoed back 'two functions:' as the last chars of a 494-char prompt (i.e. it received only line 1, 67 chars). Affects the ollama provider path identically.
2026-09-02T17:59:38-06:00 FIX (for the owning session): invoke node + cli.js directly instead of pi.cmd: [<nodejs-lts>/node.exe, <nodejs-lts bin>/node_modules/@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent/dist/bundle/cli.js, ...same args]. Verified full prompt arrives intact this way.
